{"speciesId":563,"names":{"fr":"Tutankafer","es":"Cofagrigus","en":"Cofagrigus","ja":"デスカーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il paraît qu’il avale les gens et les transforme en momies. Il adore manger des lingots d’or."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has been said that they swallow those who get too close and turn them into mummies. They like to eat gold nuggets."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il prend l’apparence d’un beau cercueil pour punir les pilleurs de tombes. Son corps est recouvert d’or pur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They pretend to be elaborate coffins to teach lessons to grave robbers. Their bodies are covered in pure gold."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Grave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Grave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il paraît qu’il avale les gens et les transforme en momies. Il adore manger des lingots d’or."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se comenta que engulle a todo humano que se le acerca y lo momifica. Su comida favorita son las pepitas de oro."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has been said that they swallow those who get too close and turn them into mummies. They like to eat gold nuggets."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"近づいた 人間を 飲みこんで ミイラに してしまうという ウワサ。 金塊を 好んで 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il prend l’apparence d’un beau cercueil. Les pilleurs de tombes imprudents finissent enfermés à l’intérieur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Atrapan en su interior a los ladrones de tumbas que los confunden con ataúdes de verdad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Grave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies."},{"language":"ja","vers